  "body": "Imagine waking up each morning with the sparkling beaches of Rothesay Bay and Browns Bay just a gentle stroll from your doorstep. Great sea view upstairs, with sunlight dances on the waves, inviting you to start your day with fresh sea air or unwind with an evening walk along the sand. The laughter of children at nearby playgrounds creates a vibrant community feel, perfect for families and all who cherish an active, outdoor lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe flexible floorplan boasts 4 generous bedrooms, 2 living areas, and 3.5 bathrooms (including 2 master ensuite). There’s even scope for you to add your personal touch and make it truly yours. Entertain with ease in multiple sun-drenched open plan living zones, or step outside onto the private back yard, perfect for alfresco dining or simply soaking up the sunshine with friends and family. The gourmet kitchen is a chef’s dream, with premium top European appliances and exquisite design for effortless meal preparation and entertaining. An upper-level living area & internal-access double garage provide ample room for family or visitors, enhance everyday convenience, with additional off-street parking for your guests.\r\n\r\nStep outside and immerse yourself in the bustling heart of Browns Bay township. Indulge in your choice of charming cafés, diverse restaurants, and boutique shops. Every daily convenience is at your fingertips, from essential amenities to leisurely weekend markets—making life here both effortless and enjoyable.\r\n\r\nFor families, the value of this location is truly unmatched. Your children’s education is set up for success, with highly regarded Browns Bay Primary School just across the road, and seamless progression to Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College, all within the coveted school zones. This not only offers peace of mind but also adds enduring value to your investment.\r\n\r\nHere, you’re not just buying a home—you’re embracing a lifestyle rich in comfort, convenience, and coastal charm. Come and experience the best of Rothesay Bay & Browns Bay living—where every day feels like a holiday and your future is always bright.",
